# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# NeuroGuard AI — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env and fill in your values. NEVER commit .env to version control.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Environment ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ENVIRONMENT=development          # development | staging | production
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# ── PostgreSQL ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev (Docker Compose):
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://neuroguard:neuroguard_password@localhost:5432/neuroguard
# Production (AWS RDS — use IAM auth or Secrets Manager in prod):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://neuroguard_app:<PASSWORD>@neuroguard-postgres.xxxx.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com:5432/neuroguard

POSTGRES_USER=neuroguard
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=neuroguard_password
POSTGRES_DB=neuroguard

# ── Redis ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
# Production (AWS ElastiCache with TLS):
# REDIS_URL=rediss://<cluster>.cache.amazonaws.com:6379/0

# ── Auth0 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Create a free Auth0 account at https://auth0.com
# Application type: Regular Web Application
AUTH0_DOMAIN=your-tenant.auth0.com
AUTH0_AUDIENCE=https://api.neuroguard.health
AUTH0_CLIENT_ID=your_auth0_client_id
AUTH0_CLIENT_SECRET=your_auth0_client_secret

# ── JWT ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For dev: generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`
# For prod: Auth0 provides RS256 keys automatically via JWKS
JWT_SECRET=replace-with-64-char-hex-string-for-development-only
JWT_ALGORITHM=RS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL=900
REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL=2592000

# ── Field-Level Encryption (AES-256-GCM) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Generate: python -c "from cryptography.hazmat.primitives import hashes; from cryptography.hazmat.backends import default_backend; import os, base64; print(base64.urlsafe_b64encode(os.urandom(32)).decode())"
FIELD_ENCRYPTION_KEY=replace-with-base64-encoded-32-byte-key

# ── AWS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=wJalrXUtnFEMI/K7MDENG/bPxRfiCYEXAMPLEKEY
AWS_DEFAULT_REGION=us-east-1
# For local dev, MinIO provides S3-compatible storage (already in docker-compose)
S3_ENDPOINT_URL=http://localhost:9000    # Remove for real AWS
S3_BUCKET_REPORTS=neuroguard-reports
S3_BUCKET_MODELS=neuroguard-models
S3_BUCKET_AUDIT=neuroguard-audit
AWS_KMS_KEY_ID=alias/neuroguard-phi     # Leave blank for local dev (unencrypted)

# ── Kafka ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS=localhost:9092
KAFKA_TOPIC_HEALTH_EVENTS=health.events
KAFKA_TOPIC_RISK_SCORES=risk.scores
KAFKA_TOPIC_ALERTS=alerts.notifications

# ── Firebase (Push notifications) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Download google-services.json from Firebase Console
# Paste the service account JSON here as a single line (or point to the file path)
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON={"type":"service_account","project_id":"..."}
# Or use file path:
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/app/secrets/firebase-service-account.json

# ── SendGrid (Email notifications) ────────────────────────────────────────────
SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.replace_with_your_sendgrid_api_key
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@neuroguard.health
EMAIL_FROM_NAME=NeuroGuard AI

# ── APNs (iOS Push) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
APNS_KEY_ID=XXXXXXXXXX
APNS_TEAM_ID=XXXXXXXXXX
APNS_CERT_PATH=/app/secrets/apns_cert.p8
APNS_TOPIC=health.neuroguard.app
APNS_USE_SANDBOX=true      # Set false for production App Store builds

# ── Sentry (Error tracking) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SENTRY_DSN=https://your-sentry-dsn@sentry.io/project-id
SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=0.1

# ── Next.js Web Dashboard ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=NeuroGuard AI
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=replace-with-random-32-char-string-for-nextauth

# ── Differential Privacy / Federated Learning ─────────────────────────────────
FL_EPSILON_PER_ROUND=0.5
FL_TOTAL_EPSILON_BUDGET=10.0
FL_DELTA=0.00001
FL_MAX_GRAD_NORM=1.0
FL_NOISE_MULTIPLIER=1.1
FL_MIN_CLIENTS_PER_ROUND=10
FL_CLIENT_FRACTION=0.2
FL_MAX_ROUNDS=200

# ── Mobile app (Flutter) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These go in mobile/lib/core/config/app_config.dart or --dart-define
FLUTTER_API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8000/api/v1    # Android emulator → host
# FLUTTER_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1  # iOS simulator → host

# ── Rate limits ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AUTH_RATE_LIMIT=5/15minute
API_RATE_LIMIT=100/minute
FL_UPDATE_RATE_LIMIT=1/hour

# ── Internal service URLs (set automatically in Docker Compose / K8s) ─────────
AUTH_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8001
HEALTH_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8003
RISK_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8004
ALERTS_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8005
REPORTS_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8006
FEDERATED_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8007
